  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORE FUNDING TO MISEAN CARA, WHICH PROVIDES GRANTS TO MISSIONARY ORGANISATIONS FOR THEIR DEVELOPMENT WORK IN AFRICA, ASIA AND SOUTH AMERICA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARTNER: Spiritans PROJECT: Spiritans support agricultural development for farmers by improving access to water points for irrigation purposes during the dry season and, vegetable and cereal seeds that can serve both the dry and rainy seasons. By their engagement in food production both in dry and rainy seasons, the farmers shall ensure constant supply of food to the households, and hence, household members shall be assured of three meals per day</narrative>
  </description>
